{"diagnosis": "Loopback read via reg_dat_do returned recv_buf_data 0x00 instead of expected 0xa5, causing TRAP uart data mismatch and tohost FAIL 0xdead. The gate recv_buf_valid is 1 at reset so reg_dat_do = recv_buf_valid ? recv_buf_data : ~0 reports stale zero as valid before any RX completes. Root cause is reset assignment recv_buf_valid <= 1 in the recv always @(posedge clk) block; it must be 0 to gate reg_dat_do until state 10 loads real recv_pattern.", "patch_diff": "diff --git a/picosoc/simpleuart.v b/picosoc/simpleuart.v
--- a/picosoc/simpleuart.v
+++ b/picosoc/simpleuart.v
@@ -72,1 +72,1 @@
-			recv_buf_valid <= 1;
+			recv_buf_valid <= 0;
", "expected": "tohost PASS (was FAIL 0xdead), loopback got 0xa5 want 0xa5 with no TRAP uart data mismatch"}

